      "description_en": "Filter by labels, format `[{\"name\":\"label name\",\"value\":\"label value\"},{\"name\":\"label name\",\"value\":\"label value\"}]`.\nExisting label name explanations: \n\n- MetricCategory: Description of the metric category  \n- alertEnable: Whether an alert is needed  \n- alertUnit: Suggested alert unit \n- unitFactor: Unit conversion factor  \n- minAlertPeriod: Minimum alert period  \n- productCategory: Product type category ",
      "description_zh": "根据标签过滤，格式`[{\"name\":\"标签名\",\"value\":\"标签值\"},{\"name\":\"标签名\",\"value\":\"标签值\"}] `。\n已有的标签name说明： \n\n- MetricCategory：监控项分类的描述  \n- alertEnable：是否需要报警  \n- alertUnit：建议的报警单位 \n- unitFactor：单位转换系数  \n- minAlertPeriod：最小报警周期  \n- productCategory：产品类型分类 ",
      "example": "[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"alertUnit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"%\\\"}]",
      "help_en": "Filter by labels, format `[{\"name\":\"label name\",\"value\":\"label value\"},{\"name\":\"label name\",\"value\":\"label value\"}]`.\nExisting label name explanations: \n\n- MetricCategory: Description of the metric category  \n- alertEnable: Whether an alert is needed  \n- alertUnit: Suggested alert unit \n- unitFactor: Unit conversion factor  \n- minAlertPeriod: Minimum alert period  \n- productCategory: Product type category ",
      "help_zh": "根据标签过滤，格式`[{\"name\":\"标签名\",\"value\":\"标签值\"},{\"name\":\"标签名\",\"value\":\"标签值\"}] `。\n已有的标签name说明： \n\n- MetricCategory：监控项分类的描述  \n- alertEnable：是否需要报警  \n- alertUnit：建议的报警单位 \n- unitFactor：单位转换系数  \n- minAlertPeriod：最小报警周期  \n- productCategory：产品类型分类 ",
